Unauthenticated administrative access must fail:

```bash
curl -i http://localhost:8088/api/admin/subgraphs
```

Expected: `401 Unauthorized`.

Malformed subgraph names must fail:

```bash
curl -i -X POST http://localhost:8088/api/admin/subgraphs \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer local-admin-token' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{"name":"Invalid_Name","url":"http://accounts-subgraph:4001/graphql"}'
```

Expected: `400` with `validation_error`.

Unauthorized GraphQL traffic must fail when `SANTINI_CLIENT_TOKEN` is set:

```bash
curl -i http://localhost:8088/graphql \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{"query":"query { __typename }"}'
```

Expected: `401 Unauthorized`.